- Complete quarterly Quality Assessments for each program (Tally);
- Regulatory File Audits and Preparation;
- Will assist in administrative responsibilities focused on office progress and improving office operations and procedures;
- Other duties as assigned.

**HR Coordinator Skills and Knowledge**

- Excellent computer skills, including Word and Excel in a Microsoft Windows environment;
